  ('188043f5-a63f-55bc-adb9-d4ef0e61099d', '7cef5ba5-b16e-5ad6-a2e1-3614a6b3cc74', 'Mathematics, Economics and one (1) other subject.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics and Economics plus any other two (2) relevant subjects.', 'Two (2) `A'' Level passes to include Economics and Mathematics.'),
  ('aef36b72-5eb5-50a2-90dd-493052885e54', '16d44842-938a-53df-ac52-5c7cb4c84827', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('0b74d6ef-2447-51d8-91f8-05142244ac28', 'c88080a9-c3ac-51fb-bc31-dbfcf480a2b1', 'Literature in English, Economics and Government.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include English Language, Literature in English and Government plus a pass in Mathematics.', 'Two (2) `A'' Level passes in Literature in English, Economics or Government.'),
  ('8b39365a-ca80-5ac8-b219-a9e1dae5b5b8', '37442666-f5e7-50b9-bde1-ff274e9eab88', 'Economics and Two (2) other subjects.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Economics and three (3) other subjects plus at least a pass in Mathematics. For NBC holders, three (3) other Subjects could be from any of the following: Office Practice, Secretarial Duties, Principles of Accounts, Shorthand 80 WPM and Typewriting 35 WPM.', 'Two (2) ''A'' Level passes chosen from Economics, Accounting and Business Management.'),
  ('2395eb97-3a30-5b0c-afce-7e0937abe6c1', 'f7fa1d49-ad1d-5896-b79f-9777e2034bab', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('9fc3bd35-114c-5d79-bcae-aced6af591e0', 'fcd27b2f-7245-53fe-a4f4-75b64fc1b664', 'Economics, Mathematics and any of Government, History, Geography, Literature in English, French', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Economics and any two (2) of Arts or Social Science subjects.', 'Two (2) `A'' Level passes in Economics and any one (1) of Mathematics, Statistics, Geography, Physics, Chemistry, Agricultural Science, Accounting, Business Management, History and Government.'),
  ('6ed2a4db-91a3-5fc1-8af1-8ffd4d19c582', '841c8d3f-7bc3-5fc6-b216-3eb0fba28b52', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('9330d3b4-7b69-5c35-8fcf-62c44c3dccb2', 'da292745-0c62-5c84-8821-3db6f435e769', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('afe7337a-bbe5-5a11-9691-1fd1af4f8b58', '988b6128-2185-5b74-be0e-e7dc6badf4cd', 'UTME: (i) AUN same as in Finance (ii) BIU accepts credit/merit in English Language and Mathematics at TC II as ''O'' Level equivalent. (iii) EVANGEL- Economics is not compulsory but accepts any three (3) relevant subjects. (iv) FED-DUTSINMA requires Five `O'' level Credits to include: English Language, Mathematics, Economics/Financial Accounting and any other two Management or Social Sciences subjects. (v) FED-WUKARI – Same as in Economics. (vi) JOS in addition to the UTME requirements requires two (2) `O'' Level credit passes in any of Business Studies, Commerce, Government, Principles of Accounts, Geography and Biology. (vii) LAGOS requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Economics and any two (2) from Financial Accounting/Principles of Accounting, Further Mathematics, Literature in English, Geography, Government, Biology, Business Management, and Data Processing/Computer Studies. (viii) PHC does not accept Commercial subjects except Financial Accounting or Business Methods/Management. (ix) PHC requires Five (5) SSC credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Economics and any other two (2) subjects from Government/History, Geography, Commerce, Literature in English, CRK/IRK, Accounting (Financial/Business), Biology/Agricultural Science, Chemistry, Physics. (x) PLASU accepts Commerce or Principles of Accounting In lieu of Economics. (xi) UNN requires five (5) O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics Economics and any other two (2) relevant subjects. For NBC holders, the other two (2) relevant subjects could be from any of Accounting, Principles of Accounts, Commerce, Office Practice and Secretarial Duties. (xii) UYO requires `O'' Level credit pass in Economics. (xiii) LCITY requires `O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Economics/Commerce and any other two (2) subjects. (xiv) AAUA requires five (5) `O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Economics/Commerce, and two others from Accounting/Bookkeeping, Geography and Government. (xv) ABU requires Five (5) SSC credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Economics and any other two (2) other subjects. For NBC holders, the other two (2) relevant subjects could be from any of Principles of Accounts, Commerce, Office Practice and Secretarial Duties. UTME SUBJECTS (i) AUN same as in Finance. (ii) BSU requires Economics. (iii) IGBINEDION accepts Commerce In lieu of Economics. (iv) CARITAS requires Mathematics, Economics plus any Social Science or Arts subject. (v) EVANGEL accepts Principles of Accounts In lieu of Mathematics. (vi) FED-DUTSINMA requires Mathematics, English Language, Economics/Financial Accounting and any other Social and Management Science subject. (vii) LAGOS accepts Mathematics, Economics, plus one (1) Subject from the following: Financial Accounting, Further Mathematics, Geography, Government, Literature in English and Biology. (viii) OAU requires Principles of Accounts not Commerce.', NULL, NULL),
  ('a86b2cc4-0580-5c86-ace5-b228362c7758', 'e85441a8-6047-515f-ab09-0bc916842d8d', NULL, NULL, NULL),
