  ('65d23273-a498-5646-b807-a6365b386499', '8e28c942-a329-5fc6-aaed-2eb339c34723', 'Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry or Geography', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes including Physics, Mathematics and English Language and either Chemistry or Geography', '(i) ND upper credit in Meteorology in addition to the ''O'' Level requirements. OR (ii) WMO Class II Certificate in Weather Forecasting in addition to the ''O'' Level requirements. (iii) ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics and Physics in addition to the SSC requirements.'),
