  ('314f2f85-37a9-5715-8d02-98a1e462f8e2', 'a8b52c1d-c5d3-5c87-b49a-a84f46cc4bb6', 'Mathematics, Physics and Biology or Agricultural Science or Chemistry or Geography.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes including English Language, Physics, Mathematics, Chemistry and Biology/Agricultural Science or Geography.', '(i) Two (2) ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics and any other Science subject. (ii) NCE merit/HND/ND upper credit in Mathematics.'),
