  ('d092d46c-3c39-5c42-b805-2714958c3c09', '7543ae81-5433-5429-ba08-51e6559b634f', 'dda275df-5e8f-50bc-8aba-27af698a4e74', '(xxxii) EUI accepts; a) Two (2) ''A'' Level passes including Government or History and one Social Science subject. b) ND/HND with credit passes in relevant field. c) NCE with a minimum of Merit in any related Social/Management Science. d) Very good passes in JUPEB/IJMB subjects: Government and any two (2) of Literature in English, Economics, History and Religious Studies. e) B.Sc. in related discipline with minimum of Second Class Lower. | (xxv) EUI requires five (5) credit passes at SSC or its equivalent in English Language, Mathematics, Government or History and any other two (2) Arts or Social Science subjects at not more than two (2) sittings.'),
