  ('19bfc7ac-6b49-5418-8c11-0584eba0ebbd', 'e6c3392c-accc-5515-a9ce-560b9790aede', 'dda275df-5e8f-50bc-8aba-27af698a4e74', '(xii) JOS in addition to the ''A'' Level passes required, credit passes at the ordinary level must include English Language, Government or History.'),
  ('8b27d420-20a5-55c6-8df1-3618531d7f05', 'accf0ac6-2d45-515e-99a3-226d5e64b71a', 'dda275df-5e8f-50bc-8aba-27af698a4e74', '(xxxiii) KASU accepts Two `A'' Level passes including Government/History and one other Arts or Social Science subjects. HND/ND Lower Credit in Political Science, International studies, Public Administration/ Local Government studies and NCE Merit in related fields. IJMB with 7 points and above in Social Science subject. | (xii) KASU requires ''O'' Level credit pass in Mathematics. | (xxxii) KASU requires Five `O'' level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Government or History and two other subjects in Arts or Social Sciences. | (xxii) KASU requires Government or History and two other subjects in Arts or Social Sciences.')
