  ('7aaa022b-4c0f-5da0-b376-eb167da86a81', '26ce26b0-5eac-5286-b8b5-179e56a6b320', 'dda275df-5e8f-50bc-8aba-27af698a4e74', '(vii) LAGOS requires Very good passes in three JUPEB/A'' Level subjects: Government and any two of Literature-in-English, Economics, CRS/IRS and History. | (xvi) LAGOS requires Five `O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Government, Economics/Geography and any one of History, Literature-in-English and CRS/IRS. | (v) LAGOS requires English Language, Government, Economics/Geography and any one of History, Literature-in-English, CRS/IRS.'),
