  ('188076af-a6c8-5e04-ad29-41be49c3026c', '9563ec0e-64c3-5553-97d2-48342fdf18fc', '6855b440-2e5d-5f8b-af6f-5bf61739249f', '(ix) NILE accepts any two (2) ''A'' Level passes in Arts or Social Science subjects, ND/HND lower credit or NCE merit in relevant programmes or subjects. | (vi) NILE accepts Government/History/Civic Education and any two (2) Arts or Social Sciences subjects. [UTME SUBJECTS]'),
