  ('18c4ae91-befb-5c6e-8ef5-72328b7e52c8', '32ed37ab-c7e4-5072-af80-ce3659ab6a7b', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (xx) DELSU requires GCE ''A'' Level passes in at least two (2) subjects which should include a Social Science subject. | UTME (xxii) DELSU requires five credit passes at SSC ''O'' Level or its equivalent which should include English Language, Mathematics and Biology/Health Sciences and two (2) of Social Science & Arts subjects. | UTME SUBJECTS (viii) DELSU requires and any three (3) subjects from Social Science.'),
  ('a1d45e48-226a-59a1-81d3-7ce2e4c10fec', 'e7c6659e-a0dc-560a-943f-4ec52c0df473', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('a59ed504-a243-50cb-959a-70304aeafcb9', '2eeb38d3-f2b6-5e5f-8495-08af1af1d88e', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (iii) BSU, EBSU and RENAISSANCE require a. any two (2) ''A'' Level passes plus the UTME requirements. b. ND plus four (4) ''O'' Level credit passes to include Chemistry, Biology or Health Science or General Science plus the UTME requirements. c. Registered Nurse Certificate plus ''O'' Level credit passes in Biology/Health Science/General Science and a pass in Mathematics/Statistics plus the UTME requirements | DIRECT ENTRY (xi) EBSU accepts HND, NCE and ND with a minimum of merit and upper credit respectively in relevant programmes. | UTME (xviii) EBSU requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Biology and any other relevant subject from Arts, Social Sciences or Sciences. | UTME SUBJECTS (vi) EBSU – Economics is not compulsory.'),
  ('c19ebf2b-db97-512c-85c3-6a14edf9290a', 'ee44316c-07fd-5ce2-93dc-a98a8095998d', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'UTME (ix) EKSU as in Political Science. | UTME SUBJECTS (i) UYO, RENAISSANCE, OAU and EKSU require Biology.'),
  ('65ae3fb1-ad93-522a-bce8-82c66834ed19', '8f0b6aa4-f525-540f-a351-ddb51bd3421a', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('cfe51cc3-21d9-59c0-8028-7d8c01bbd95e', 'f3bd8dbc-ffcb-5d4b-8e8d-310ce5ef5f55', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (iv) ESUTECH and IBADAN require two (2) ''A'' Level passes from Arts, Science or Social Science subjects | UTME (x) ESUTECH requires ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics plus at least a pass in Biology/Health Science/Agricultural Science. | UTME SUBJECTS (iv) ESUTECH requires Biology or Agricultural Science and any two (2) other Social Science or Arts subjects.'),
  ('e244d42b-de9d-551d-bce7-ced49a42bb48', 'df55ed4b-dcd1-522b-985b-afd17113826f', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (xxi) FED-GASHUA accepts OND/ND (Upper Credit), HND (Lower Credit) and NCE Merit and above into 200 Level. | UTME (xiii) FED-GASHUA as in Political Science. | UTME SUBJECTS (xii) FED-GASHUA accepts Biology and two (2) others from either Arts, Science or Social Science subjects.'),
  ('493122e4-20ae-50a3-99e5-522dd1edabc4', 'cc548faf-07a4-5541-93c3-535da80d4d5e', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (xxii) FED-KASHERE accepts Minimum of Lower Credit in ND or recognised Diploma or 9 Points in IJMB/NCE in related Social Science discipline. | UTME (xxiv) FED-KASHERE requires Five credit passes at SSCE (or its equivalent) in English, Mathematics, Biology, Economics and two other Social Sciences subjects. | UTME SUBJECTS (xv) FED-KASHERE requires Any three subjects from Arts or Social Sciences.'),
  ('68ba31c4-b77b-5b6c-9d2b-62fc40d9f201', '7f1e09fa-66eb-50d0-b12b-a66eecc30366', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('8eaee035-8318-523a-bed1-b225eec946d8', 'a7537f3d-dd55-5419-9e59-c906e666b2e9', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('e575f07a-2db1-5fea-bb10-3db694dd106a', 'cd4edfad-172a-5f76-b45e-f806306ef788', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (xvii) FED-OYE EKITI accepts ND (Upper Credit) in Social Science related courses. It also accepts A'' level passes in any Social Science subjects in addition to O'' level requirements. | UTME (xvi) FED-OYE EKITI requires five (5) `O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Biology, Economics and any one of Social Science or Science subjects. | UTME SUBJECTS (ix) FED-OYE EKITI requires any three (3) subjects from Science or Social Sciences.'),
  ('34455b64-5ed0-5cfb-a013-da6ab918940b', '73700bdc-7a5a-5ba5-887e-0e86a917f1ba', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (xv) GOUU – Same as in Philosophy. | UTME (vii) GOUU requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include English language, Mathematics, Biology and any other two (2) Science, Social Science or Arts subjects at not more than one sitting.'),
  ('69b976e7-68b4-5030-b12f-de889aee47c6', 'e1c071b0-e046-51f0-9de7-77ac53886688', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (iv) ESUTECH and IBADAN require two (2) ''A'' Level passes from Arts, Science or Social Science subjects | DIRECT ENTRY (xii) IBADAN accepts a. two (2) ''A'' Level passes from Arts, Science or Social Science subjects. b. a Science subject with a pass in Mathematics. | UTME (iii) IBADAN accepts Science subjects with a pass in ''O'' Level Mathematics. | UTME (xvii) IBADAN accepts five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Biology and any other three (3) from Social Sciences, Sciences and Arts with at least a pass in Mathematics. | UTME SUBJECTS (iii) IBADAN - any three (3) subjects.'),
  ('9cea9649-d4d7-588d-8a78-4048e97a75b6', 'be4981eb-2b54-5ea1-941d-44e8ca2774db', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('94032288-175a-5cbc-be3e-661d07f8bdde', '308b7f5a-13c7-5fc0-8c29-5cac2ac5d469', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (i) IMSU - No direct entry | UTME (v) UYO and IMSU require ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Biology/Health Science plus a pass in Mathematics. UYO requires a credit pass in Biology or Health Science and at least a D7 pass in Mathematics.'),
  ('5fd384b1-026b-55db-9220-bd775e69cff5', 'e6c3392c-accc-5515-a9ce-560b9790aede', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (vi) JOS accepts Diploma distinction/merit and advanced Diploma in applied Psychology. | UTME (i) JOS requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include Mathematics, English Language and Biology.'),
  ('c0a485e7-de3f-5c09-b72d-3359398c51dc', '26ce26b0-5eac-5286-b8b5-179e56a6b320', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (xvi) LAGOS accepts Very good passes in three JUPEB/A'' Level subjects: Biology and any two of Economics, Government, Chemistry, Physics and Literature-in-English. | UTME (xiii) LAGOS require Five `O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Biology and any two subjects from Social Sciences, Arts and Science (including Health Education, Health Science and Integrated Science). UNILAG does not accept Commerce, CRS/IRS and Financial Accounting. | UTME (xix) LAGOS requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Biology and any two (2) subjects from Social Sciences, Arts and Sciences: Health Education, Health Science and Integrated Science. LAGOS does not accept Commerce, Christian Religious Studies /Islamic Studies and Financial Accounting. | UTME SUBJECTS (v) LAGOS requires English Language and any three subjects from Mathematics. Biology, Physics, Chemistry, Economics, Government, Literature-in-English.'),
  ('0d14208d-cd77-5a3b-a471-8e980843dc02', '4208cf5b-56b9-56ab-809d-9d17f1f3488d', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (ix) LASU requires ''A'' Level passes in Economics, Geography or Government. | UTME (xii) LASU requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language and Mathematics, Biology and any two (2) of Commerce, Economics, Geography and Government. | UTME SUBJECTS (vii) LASU accepts Science subjects.'),
  ('471979e9-e282-5e7a-9adc-be269bbdfc77', '49133bab-9c43-5b01-89b0-5e2dde1b8969', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('c6658d90-2f19-5db0-b1ec-a438a19f234d', '2ad5a1cd-7c4a-5d35-a882-ca7417d9d6bd', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('39fa2f14-5a25-5183-aa5f-f9aec7f0d0d5', '0bae7376-176a-5cd3-aeee-f0c45ec47aea', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('ef735869-4abe-504e-a17d-7a73443b6315', '97cc25e7-b0b9-542d-8da4-a78fa4f017bc', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (x) NASARAWA requires ''O'' Level credit pass in Biology/Health Science.'),
  ('e9e2d357-94bf-55f8-ab34-49779f7741f8', '9f17d6a3-5eee-545c-bd35-63bc79c5cb4a', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('09e068d4-4f7e-5c44-b4f0-f01c04167b74', '1c45a50a-ca0e-54eb-9f35-3be6de7b2e83', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'UTME (xxi) NDA requires two (2) other Arts and Social Science subjects from Economics, Government, Civic Education, Chemistry and Geography.'),
  ('a3c88015-000e-5840-a0b1-6847fa4e3be9', '9563ec0e-64c3-5553-97d2-48342fdf18fc', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('ce97525e-4470-56a3-83ca-98dc0ef2fe86', '3c13885c-9b61-5e63-a6d1-c5f8b9ae2266', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (ii) OAU requires a. Registered Nursing (RN) Certificate, upper credit at ND/HND in Social Work or Medical Laboratory Science b. ''A'' Level passes in Biology and any two (2) of Economics, Government, Physics, Chemistry. | DIRECT ENTRY (xiii) OAU accepts two (2) ''A'' Level in Science or Social Sciences. | UTME (iv) OAU requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Biology and any two (2) from Geography, Economics, Government, Chemistry, Physics, History, Literature in English, Yoruba, Christian Religious Studies /Islamic Studies, Agricultural Science, ICT, Civic Education. | UTME SUBJECTS (i) UYO, RENAISSANCE, OAU and EKSU require Biology. | UTME SUBJECTS (ii) OAU requires any three (3) from Mathematics, Economics, Government, Geography, Physics, Chemistry and Biology.'),
  ('b822fcc1-fb31-5cca-8b28-f50430a9a912', '0b2a9d40-1151-53c2-afa0-dda8f622ef86', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('9a6c8772-8151-5d87-a450-75d4e1a7a70e', 'f7c295d5-15f5-5895-a7d5-2c348521c2cc', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('8beedd2d-be25-5338-ae24-f063ae271eae', '234b5aeb-1ef0-507d-8d9a-153a485393cc', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('942daa66-f100-5f4f-98aa-d911ecda3e36', 'c92766ca-948d-5e15-ba6d-60b130aeb494', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('310caf8c-0809-53bb-bc2a-f4f12b1c4e4f', 'bf0a9b2b-9fd6-5e7e-9c88-6c372119fa86', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (xix) PLASU accepts a. Degree in any programme provided the candidate meets UTME requirements. b. HND minimum of lower credit in relevant programme plus UTME requirements. c. ND minimum of lower credit in relevant programme plus UTME requirements. d. IJMB minimum of 7 points with passes in relevant subjects, plus UTME requirements. e. Does not accept university diplomas and other diplomas not accredited by the relevant accrediting bodies.'),
  ('45c46c35-019d-5504-9333-c8c370fce24c', 'c56fe7bf-62ad-5caf-bfa8-3228f9f222bd', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('d866d16f-ae9d-5279-a130-56e6b577f4ab', '6fbab45b-7864-5444-8af6-ae5a830fb19a', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'UTME (xiv) REDEEMERS requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics and any other three (3) subjects which must include Biology.'),
  ('890dcd53-9ca5-5aa3-bc5c-87df9cdedecd', '16a3ef72-058e-5780-a102-23dd9eefe971', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (iii) BSU, EBSU and RENAISSANCE require a. any two (2) ''A'' Level passes plus the UTME requirements. b. ND plus four (4) ''O'' Level credit passes to include Chemistry, Biology or Health Science or General Science plus the UTME requirements. c. Registered Nurse Certificate plus ''O'' Level credit passes in Biology/Health Science/General Science and a pass in Mathematics/Statistics plus the UTME requirements | UTME SUBJECTS (i) UYO, RENAISSANCE, OAU and EKSU require Biology.'),
  ('f1f4535a-741c-5099-98ec-5eb16491c416', '0a012370-5686-58d1-8d4e-296446853862', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (xxiii) RSU accepts Admissions into Year III; Degree relevant to the Programme. HND (Upper Credit) relevant to the Programme. Admissions into Year II; HND (Lower Credit) relevant to the Programme. OND/ND (Upper Credit) relevant to the discipline. Degree (Third Class) relevant to the programme. In addition, all such candidates above must also satisfy the UME entry requirements. | UTME (xxv) RSU requires Five (5) WASC/SSCE/ GCE/NECO `O'' Level Credit passes including English Language, Mathematics, Biology/Health Science/Agricultural Science and any two (2) Social Science Subject. | UTME SUBJECTS (xvi) RSU requires English Language, Government/History, and any two (2) Social Science/Art Subjects.'),
  ('306cceec-406e-5545-931d-c8a90ce119b0', 'e98b5d0e-effb-53f7-aec2-8485199a5b5c', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('3290a017-4b2b-5bc5-8e3d-5a03d0d5b55e', 'a8615ddc-26f0-5d2b-ba4e-b49c545b0163', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('01652c4f-cde9-5372-b2e3-860ae9647a17', '14be5fe8-f55e-5851-a1df-21d97796e5d2', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('9918ca05-1e62-51a9-98eb-522739be0a85', '511f36cd-22bd-5e2a-accf-432b24ea59dd', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('80f7d670-2b7d-51ce-911d-db4a10b6bd73', '3a9f0243-a4ff-53cc-aa6f-bc01c43451d7', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (v) UNIZIK accepts two (2) ''A'' Level passes, NCE/ND/HND, in Social Work, or Nursing or any other relevant areas plus at least ''O'' Level pass in Biology/Health Science/Integrated Science and Mathematics plus the UTME requirements. | UTME (vi) UNIZIK requires similar requirements as for Economics, for both Direct Entry and UTME applicants but a pass in ''O'' Level Mathematics is acceptable.'),
  ('c9b01603-d1c4-5b14-aa0a-f2843a9beea9', '64386226-1af0-5df2-89dd-bf4ce8b243e7', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', NULL),
  ('82c2617f-aa09-578c-b72a-8e5121e689ac', 'f90909a4-fcc6-5899-a1a5-dd43ce3cbbc8', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'UTME SUBJECTS (i) UNN accepts any three (3) subjects. | DIRECT ENTRY (xiv) UNN accepts Diploma certificates, NCE, ND, HND, B.SC, Registered Nursing/Midwifery, and any other relevant higher education qualifications in addition to the UTME requirements. | UTME (ii) UNN requires ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Biology or Health Science, and any other three (3) subjects at least a pass in Mathematics or Statistics. | UTME SUBJECTS (x) UNN requires Biology and any other two (2) subjects.'),
  ('c3abc04e-bfa1-5f09-a139-e320982c4b0e', '76561787-b77a-53e2-a65c-22d345d89260', 'b1ad7931-2328-5191-8727-d1af3e46802c', 'DIRECT ENTRY (viii) UYO accepts any two (2) ''A'' Level passes or RNC plus five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include Health Science or Biology and at least a pass in Mathematics. | UTME (v) UYO and IMSU require ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Biology/Health Science plus a pass in Mathematics. UYO requires a credit pass in Biology or Health Science and at least a D7 pass in Mathematics. | UTME SUBJECTS (i) UYO, RENAISSANCE, OAU and EKSU require Biology.'),
  ('5b51c17c-d296-562a-b0ce-97fb948b601a', '929f28a0-ddd3-5a6a-8e8f-90942af20ac0', '9f5b16dc-5db1-5559-afb5-b3fe5c8c6503', NULL),
