  ('5d6b746c-2bdc-529d-b954-0d8d8f817e93', '7b5e2930-09df-5b45-b6e4-706d02fface6', '5caf5d31-f105-5189-9702-1ce445589cfa', NULL),
  ('d466a163-3490-5273-8902-e91c132cd85d', 'b3b5ba8a-6573-57f7-b4f1-11c42e383729', '5caf5d31-f105-5189-9702-1ce445589cfa', '(iii) BENIN requires two (2) ''A'' Level passes including any Social Science subject; ND upper credit/HND lower credit in relevant Social Science programmes such as public Administration, Mass Communication; NCE overall merit with a credit in relevant Social Science subject. Direct Entry candidates must satisfy the UTME requirements. | UTME (viii) BENIN requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics and any two (2) Social Science subjects. | UTME SUBJECTS (i) BENIN accepts two (2) Social Science subjects and any other subject.'),
  ('3a0eee5c-97b8-5ba8-947e-133f088a3fdf', 'ef954b01-0ec7-50cc-a305-64443a125b58', '5caf5d31-f105-5189-9702-1ce445589cfa', '(ix) BIU same as Political Science | UTME (x) BIU same as in Political Science.'),
  ('ed1f8d73-aab0-56f4-a59d-d32409153d17', '2eeb38d3-f2b6-5e5f-8495-08af1af1d88e', '5caf5d31-f105-5189-9702-1ce445589cfa', '(iv) EBSU accepts HND, NCE and ND with a minimum of Merit and upper credit respectively in relevant programmes/subjects. | UTME (i) EBSU requires ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, History/Government/Economics one science subject and any Arts or Social Science subject. | UTME SUBJECTS (vii) EBSU requires Government/History plus two (2) other social science/Arts subjects.'),
  ('602682ad-31ef-503f-b304-bb9a9c4b867d', 'f3bd8dbc-ffcb-5d4b-8e8d-310ce5ef5f55', '5caf5d31-f105-5189-9702-1ce445589cfa', '(xiii) ESUTECH requires two (2) ''A'' Level passes, including Government or History plus the UTME requirements. Accepts ND merit in Social Work/Development and Administration, plus UTME requirements. | UTME (vii) ESUTECH requires ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Government and any two (2) Arts or Social Science subjects. | UTME SUBJECTS (viii) ESUTECH requires Government.'),
  ('e0c39711-32dd-54cb-a144-668f29e1b75b', '2479d453-edec-5394-9b6c-d597957ece91', '5caf5d31-f105-5189-9702-1ce445589cfa', NULL),
  ('c6785dae-dd67-5107-9dcc-55261d8546c8', 'eb2b773f-8ee4-5799-ac95-143c6394f4d9', '5caf5d31-f105-5189-9702-1ce445589cfa', NULL),
  ('19b0611c-81de-54f8-8ca8-3c8e0de63889', 'bfd398ad-cc0f-5245-bf71-04505c05d507', '5caf5d31-f105-5189-9702-1ce445589cfa', '(xii) NDU accepts a. two (2) ''A'' Level passes in Government, Economics, Religious Knowledge, Geography, and History. b. ND upper credit in related programmes. c. NCE credit in related programmes.'),
  ('dadb445c-166c-5c93-acec-8a5fcf4f4662', '3c13885c-9b61-5e63-a6d1-c5f8b9ae2266', '5caf5d31-f105-5189-9702-1ce445589cfa', '(vi) OAU requires a. ''A'' Level passes in any three (3) from Geography, Government, History, Economics, Sociology, Christian Religious Studies/ Islamic Studies. b. ND/HND upper credit in Mass Communication, Social Work, Mathematics/Statistics. | (x) OAU accepts two (2) ''A'' Level passes in subjects such as Economics, Geography, Government / History | UTME (ii) OAU requires English Language, Mathematics and at least two (2) Social Science and one Arts subject. | UTME SUBJECTS (vi) OAU requires English Language, Mathematics, and any two (2) from Literature in English, Geography, Christian Religious Studies/ Islamic Studies/Government, History, Economics.'),
  ('f88e39b5-e807-50a8-af71-ae355eeaeed3', 'f90909a4-fcc6-5899-a1a5-dd43ce3cbbc8', '5caf5d31-f105-5189-9702-1ce445589cfa', '(i) UNN accepts two (2) ''A'' Level passes in Social Science or Arts subjects in addition to the UTME requirements. | UTME (vi) UNN requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes which must include English Language, one Science subject, and at least three (3) Arts or Social Science subjects.'),
  ('523061db-faf2-5e14-8579-62e42aa204cf', '76561787-b77a-53e2-a65c-22d345d89260', '5caf5d31-f105-5189-9702-1ce445589cfa', '(v) UYO accepts ND/HND/NCE in relevant programmes plus the UTME requirements. | UTME (iii) UYO requires at least ''O'' Level pass in Mathematics'),
  ('86ad0bff-ac4f-55d7-8083-79f8fab155c0', 'ef542dde-3868-5cfe-8785-9ba7c46a333a', '5caf5d31-f105-5189-9702-1ce445589cfa', NULL),
  ('68fec181-f140-5201-a143-320f97d2e510', '9b50b201-9aba-513c-8806-9d747d277be3', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', NULL),
  ('c743eb84-d45d-5471-b7cc-953ac2df5d89', 'b3b5ba8a-6573-57f7-b4f1-11c42e383729', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', '(ii) BENIN accepts in addition to the UTME requirements either a. two (2) ''A'' Level passes to include Government or History. b. ND upper credit in relevant programmes from a recognised Polytechnic or College of Technology. c. HND lower credit in relevant programmes from a recognised polytechnic or college of Technology. d. NCE credit in a Social Science subject from a recognised College of Education. In addition, candidates should have at least an overall merit. | (vi) BENIN requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Economics, Government, Geography or any other Social Science subject.'),
  ('c7a6f8f3-2bcf-5992-b92b-6b74920b19bc', '80fa8795-5ba9-5984-8fe2-c09146280362', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', NULL),
  ('da08fab7-6ba5-5029-8611-6019ba629cc6', 'dc4f0a5d-b0bd-5a7a-84e2-a4406fe8dfd8', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', '(iv) CALABAR same as in Sociology.'),
  ('714c72f1-b7c6-5040-8cbc-2260d9a94a97', '2eeb38d3-f2b6-5e5f-8495-08af1af1d88e', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', NULL),
  ('d10a5702-369f-55ee-ab09-83629d20b2d5', 'ee44316c-07fd-5ce2-93dc-a98a8095998d', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', NULL),
  ('678999ce-b84e-5601-8652-5ed32f3420ed', '7f1e09fa-66eb-50d0-b12b-a66eecc30366', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', '(v) FED-LAFIA accepts In addition to UTME requirements, DE candidate must have any of the following: IJMB: Candidates should have at least 9 points in subjects relevant to Social Work. NCE: Candidates should at least have Merit pass in a Course that is relevant to Social Work. ND should not be less than lower Credit pass in Social Development or Social Administration or any other Social Development components. | (viii) FED-LAFIA requires Five (5) Credit passes at SSCE, GCE, NECO and NABTEB O'' Level Examination Credit in Mathematics, English and three other Credits in any of the following: Economics, Government, History, CRS/IRS and any other Arts and Social Sciences subject in not more than two sittings.'),
  ('9852e150-eca9-5b92-961c-dab9632723a3', 'cf90707a-389f-5ef7-9550-3e51de569ee2', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', NULL),
  ('b2e3f47f-65b2-58b8-9577-5489a1a1af6e', '874cb3e9-b034-5191-b74e-cb4647665403', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', NULL),
  ('e6597e6c-824f-576e-b3b2-701e279979d2', 'be4981eb-2b54-5ea1-941d-44e8ca2774db', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', NULL),
  ('f0fa0a15-1d12-5cea-8b51-ff44a7abece8', '26ce26b0-5eac-5286-b8b5-179e56a6b320', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', '(iii) LAGOS accepts Very good passes in three JUPEB/A'' Level subjects: Any three of Economics, Government, Geography, History and CRS/IRS. University of Lagos Diploma in Social Development and Administration (SDA). | (i) LAGOS requires Five `O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, and any two of Economics, Government/History, Civic Education and Geography and one of Literature-in-English, CRK/IRK, any Nigerian Language and Biology.'),
  ('ad8f7dcf-baa9-5947-a4d9-d8f3b29e06c3', '2ad5a1cd-7c4a-5d35-a882-ca7417d9d6bd', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', NULL),
  ('ab652ea2-23e4-554d-8474-0d25ddf55b01', 'eb2b773f-8ee4-5799-ac95-143c6394f4d9', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', NULL),
  ('c032aaac-daff-594d-b7ae-de1feb1f2d2e', '7aeec5b4-cf56-5d90-bfa4-3371a6f54bb9', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', '(iv) PHC accepts At least two (2) A/level passes in GCE or HSC or JUPEB or IJMB in any Arts subject in addition to UTME entry requirements. | (vii) PHC requires Five (5) SSC credits including English Language and any four (4) from Economics, Commerce, Mathematics, Government/History, Geography, CRK/IRK. Note a Pass in Mathematics is compulsory, if Mathematics is not inclusive in the five credits.'),
  ('2717a187-9064-5403-a604-37cf4e9221b1', 'c56fe7bf-62ad-5caf-bfa8-3228f9f222bd', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', NULL),
  ('a2082028-4b9d-57e1-beab-515baaba46c6', '6fbab45b-7864-5444-8af6-ae5a830fb19a', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', '(iii) REDEEMERS requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics and three (3) subjects in Social Sciences or Arts.'),
  ('7ee0a470-a20e-5cd5-9da4-fe63b144f702', '511f36cd-22bd-5e2a-accf-432b24ea59dd', '733fb92a-6d77-57b6-b044-06102a212849', NULL),
