  ('42d793ec-0672-5c4d-adc0-02bc06b4e532', 'f90909a4-fcc6-5899-a1a5-dd43ce3cbbc8', '9f5b16dc-5db1-5559-afb5-b3fe5c8c6503', 'UNN accepts Direct Entry candidates for a three (3)-year programme. They are required to possess one (1) of the following qualifications: a) Two (2) `A'' Level passes or their equivalents in any of the following subjects; Government/History, Economics, Business Management, Accounting and Geography plus the UTME requirements. b) HND lower credit from recognized institutions plus the UTME requirements. c) Possession of Government is not a pre-requisite for three (3)-year Direct Entry candidates. d) ND or HND credit in Public Administration. | UTME: BSU and UNN require at least a pass in Mathematics. | UTME: UNN requires minimum entry requirements plus `O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Government or History and Mathematics.'),
  ('c19ec55e-66fa-5d7f-a861-b3453d3f6bfe', '0a0013b5-4b5a-5144-a156-8d2db266ce65', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', 'ABSU requires `A'' Level Mathematics.'),
  ('77443848-d099-51bd-b3d1-47e71fdeaee7', 'd27d7d4c-dcf3-5254-9faa-94e2991a92e3', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', 'ABU accepts Two `A'' Level / IJMB passes in Management/Social Science Subjects one of which must be Economics. A Minimum Merit in ABU Diploma in Insurance, Management, Banking or Accounting. | UTME: ABU requires Five `O'' level credit passes including English Language, Mathematics, Economics and any other two (2) Subjects. | UTME SUBJECTS: ABU requires Use of English, Economics, mathematics and any Management or Social Science Subject.'),
  ('ef4fcaaf-70fd-5486-aaaa-64a925656c24', '765cc513-63a4-5f86-8a21-e997667b9653', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', NULL),
  ('f8cc4ecf-b6b4-557a-ab91-22e2693aa40c', '2a323993-11a4-5569-905d-e90b89ee3bc7', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', NULL),
  ('f532f18b-5ec6-521b-8955-1b1d5ec61976', '9ef6e1a9-1447-55f8-9de9-14a6844e1cff', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', NULL),
