  ('e7ea0252-7793-50a5-8e8d-9a0e60b18aa6', '3daac232-0047-5076-9211-791beaabb13b', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', NULL),
  ('48be858f-a2cd-50cd-85dd-7fbeb0b3dc10', '862dfbdf-bc8b-58e0-9031-c4c30cb2b315', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', NULL),
  ('3de39b0c-72f5-5026-b921-4ddfef798790', '32ed37ab-c7e4-5072-af80-ce3659ab6a7b', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', 'EVANGEL and DELSU - As in Banking and Finance. | DELSU requires a) GCE A''Level or HSC pass in Management, Economics and at least one other subject. b) HND or ND with a grade not lower than upper credit. c) Foundation/Intermediate Examination passes of recognized professional bodies such as Chartered Institute Management of Nigeria (CIMN), Chartered Institute Marketing of Nigeria (CIMN). | UTME: DELSU requires five (5) credit at SSC ''O'' Level or its equivalent obtained at not more than two (2) sittings which must include English Language, Mathematics, Economics and two (2) Social Science subjects. | UTME SUBJECTS: DELSU requires Mathematics, Economics or Commerce and one other Social Science subject.'),
  ('3ffa3f64-6a6d-5fe2-a5c8-67d25f305ba1', '8ad8b817-0045-5081-8f1d-af80ae4f1e41', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', NULL),
  ('7b9d2caf-7c3c-54b1-b13e-def883290a10', '2eeb38d3-f2b6-5e5f-8495-08af1af1d88e', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', 'EBSU accepts HND/ND or NCE pass at credit/merit level in relevant programmes in addition to ''O'' Level requirements. ND must be at upper credit level. | UTME: EBSU - Same as in Accountancy. | UTME SUBJECTS: EBSU - Same as in Accountancy.'),
  ('cfa42aae-94de-58f0-b37d-75c6c70eb498', 'ee44316c-07fd-5ce2-93dc-a98a8095998d', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', NULL),
