  ('9e74be40-a8ad-58a7-a103-67bdcd811451', '308b7f5a-13c7-5fc0-8c29-5cac2ac5d469', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', 'IMSU and PHC - No Direct Entry. | UTME: IMSU require ''O'' Level credit pass in Economics.'),
  ('666469a4-888d-5203-b3e6-f45470c7a933', 'e6c3392c-accc-5515-a9ce-560b9790aede', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', 'JOS accepts a) Passes at A'' Level/IJMB or an approved equivalent examination in Accounting, Business Management or Economics. b) Holders of the following qualifications may also be considered for admissions into 200 level: ND lower credit in Accounting, Financial Studies, Business Administration, Banking and Finance, Insurance or any other Business course, from any recognized Institutions (Polytechnic, Technical Institutions, etc.). | UTME: JOS requires `O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics and any three (3) subjects from Principles of Accounts, Commerce, Business Methods, Statistics, Government or Economics. | UTME SUBJECTS: JOS requires Mathematics and any other two (2) subjects from Principles of Accounts, Commerce, Business Methods, Statistics, Government or Economics.'),
  ('982e0bee-4629-5aa8-8ec8-03ff61b4df8c', '0aae175e-c53b-5f79-a37b-0f759eb98d9c', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', NULL),
  ('871a5196-1ea1-5b17-8a5f-16c1644eabdc', '49133bab-9c43-5b01-89b0-5e2dde1b8969', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', 'LAUTECH requires `A'' Level passes in Economics/Business Management, Chemistry, Physics, Geography or Mathematics. | UTME SUBJECTS: LAUTECH requires any other two (2) Science subjects from Physics, Chemistry or Biology/Agricultural Science.'),
  ('a0a00e27-1a30-58cb-be08-b6199617048e', 'bc194f81-7349-522c-95e0-3e91bb950dfc', '933d3bcc-fa7b-580b-8fdb-06715cfad66e', NULL),
