  ('b2061aa7-127e-59d9-982b-8a810119ed9a', '26ce26b0-5eac-5286-b8b5-179e56a6b320', '8001154c-61d8-5d51-b22c-afdc7bfbcfa2', 'DIRECT ENTRY (iii) LAGOS accepts very good passes in three (3) JUPEB/''A'' Level subjects: Economics and any other two (2) subjects from Financial Accounting, Business Studies, Government and Geography. | UTME (ii) LAGOS requires credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Economics, and any two (2) of Financial Accounting, Geography, Government, Data Processing, Biology, Business Management and Social Studies. | UTME SUBJECT (ii) LAGOS requires as third (3rd) subject any one (1) subject from Science, Social Sciences and Arts.'),
  ('f514e66e-153c-5663-a86b-f0e8ebaf2a55', '4208cf5b-56b9-56ab-809d-9d17f1f3488d', '8001154c-61d8-5d51-b22c-afdc7bfbcfa2', NULL),
  ('1e728b27-d78d-50dc-b392-d989a1a9340f', '2ad5a1cd-7c4a-5d35-a882-ca7417d9d6bd', '8001154c-61d8-5d51-b22c-afdc7bfbcfa2', 'UTME (iii) LCITY requires ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Economics and any other two (2) subjects.'),
  ('a460f31d-1b39-5554-9ae8-1831650d6661', '6c8cdd39-351e-5f1b-b3ab-cdbec4f068e9', '8001154c-61d8-5d51-b22c-afdc7bfbcfa2', NULL),
  ('d84128c1-ff6f-5e99-a569-6968b9b0c142', '357b584e-b53b-5cb4-9f49-aa8ae157f2de', '8001154c-61d8-5d51-b22c-afdc7bfbcfa2', 'DIRECT ENTRY (v) MOUNTAIN TOP in addition to ''O'' Level requirements accepts Ordinary National Diploma from a recognised tertiary institution, with a minimum of 2nd Class Lower Division in relevant programmes. Or GCE Advanced Level or Foundation/JUPEB obtained from Mountain Top University or other recognized Universities. | UTME (iv) MOUNTAIN TOP requires five (5) `O'' Level credit passes at not more than two sittings in five (5) subjects including English Language, Mathematics and Economics. | UTME SUBJECT (iii) MOUNTAIN TOP accepts Economics and two (2) other subjects.'),
  ('82891775-a6ad-5559-857f-7327f345e367', '511f36cd-22bd-5e2a-accf-432b24ea59dd', '8001154c-61d8-5d51-b22c-afdc7bfbcfa2', 'DIRECT ENTRY (iv) UNIOSUN requires two (2) `A'' Level passes in Economics and any of one (1) of Government, History, Geography, Accounting, Mathematics or Natural or Social Science subjects. Accepts ND lower credit in Business Administration, Accounting, Banking and Finance, Statistics.'),
  ('0ca5946c-f4c5-5ec4-b09a-f63fccb3ce96', 'b89a3b5b-70cd-560a-a574-4d8bb5a6e43d', '86a02f6b-b048-58a5-a9f2-9417bea81ac3', 'DIRECT ENTRY (i) WESTERN-DEL accepts NCE, ND or HND in Nutrition and Home Economics or Catering. | UTME (i) WESTERN-DEL requires five (5) `O'' Level credit passes to include Mathematics/Physics, English Language, Chemistry, Biology/Agricultural Science, Food and Nutrition/Home Economics at not more than two (2) sittings.'),
