  ('f9128bfc-5ac9-5e0a-893b-430f1be0ee98', 'b2c7e8cf-ee09-5ad3-8156-921b71bdcacd', '75a08919-7e31-51d3-96ff-4e860021cad8', 'DIRECT ENTRY (i) CUAB requires: a) Two (2) passes at GCE Advanced Level or its equivalent with credit passes in three (3) other subjects at `O'' level or its equivalent including English Language. One of the `A'' level subjects should be Islamic Studies. b) Two (2) passes at IJMB or its equivalent including Islamic Studies with `O'' Level or its equivalent including English Language. c) Any other relevant two (2) year post-Secondary Diploma in Arabic and Islamic Studies recognised by the Senate of the University. d) Candidates without Islamic Studies at `O'' Level but possess HND/Degree may be considered for admission.'),
