  ('7f381860-d145-544d-90b7-3f86d299e4e6', '874cb3e9-b034-5191-b74e-cb4647665403', '8e5dc67d-9b56-56c2-855b-65bdebcfb61c', 'Accepts at least overall merit in OND or ND in Computer Science or any branch of Engineering. A levels credit cumulative can also be accepted, including ''O'' level certificate with credit in five subjects including Mathematics, English. At least Merit pass in NCE with Computer Science/Mathematics/Physics as Major area.'),
  ('582d7d2e-e421-5188-bb67-ffc40cd7b8dd', 'e1c071b0-e046-51f0-9de7-77ac53886688', '8e5dc67d-9b56-56c2-855b-65bdebcfb61c', 'Accepts (a) two (2) ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics, Pure or Applied and Physics. (b) ND/HND upper credit in Computer Science or any other Mathematics Based programmes.'),
  ('a028d197-d2b0-5e98-a39b-98ff07cf635e', 'be4981eb-2b54-5ea1-941d-44e8ca2774db', '8e5dc67d-9b56-56c2-855b-65bdebcfb61c', 'Requires UTME qualifications plus any of: a) minimum score of 10 points with two (2) ''A'' level passes in Mathematics and Physics; b) National Diploma (at least Upper Credit); c) HND (at least Lower Credit) in Computer Science. Diploma in Data Processing NOT acceptable. Also detailed requirements for Information and Communication Science, Telecommunication Science, and Library and Information Science.'),
  ('d5a3a85c-f437-563e-95d3-9e1cf1664943', '308b7f5a-13c7-5fc0-8c29-5cac2ac5d469', '8e5dc67d-9b56-56c2-855b-65bdebcfb61c', 'Accept ND upper credit in Computer Science or other Mathematically based programmes.'),
