  ('9e2cf248-0bd1-527f-b677-29b349dad721', 'a868159d-9676-5217-8e97-e9986cdcad57', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(x) UDU, BAYERO, MAIDUGURI and LASU accept NCE Chemistry major. | (xvi) BAYERO accepts; a) Two `A'' level passes in Chemistry and any one of Physics, Mathematics or Biology. b) OND in Sciences relevant subjects. | BAYERO requires; a) Two ''A'' level passes in Chemistry and any one of Physics, Mathematics or Physics. b) OND in Sciences relevant subjects. | BAYERO requires five (5) SSCE credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry and Biology. | BAYERO requires Chemistry and two (2) of Physics, Biology and Mathematics.'),
