  ('1793eabf-ba48-5677-a671-880ce03c98d1', 'b3b5ba8a-6573-57f7-b4f1-11c42e383729', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(i) RHEMA, OAU, UNN, OOU, BENIN, EKSU and BOWEN do not accept Biology. | (i) RHEMA, OAU, UNN, OOU, BENIN, EKSU and | (vii) BENIN in addition to the UTME requirements, accepts (a) ND upper credit, HND lower credit in Polymer Chemistry or Science Laboratory Technology and relevant programmes. (b) NCE merit with ''O'' Level credit passes in Chemistry and either Physics or Mathematics. | (ix) AUE and BENIN accepts Agricultural Science in lieu of Biology. | (viii) BENIN requires Chemistry, Physics, Biology or Mathematics. | AJAYI, IGBINEDION, IBADAN, BOWEN and BENIN as in Chemistry.'),
