  ('c5ba3a1d-246c-5e5b-88c4-01daed061c3f', '2d6c0715-8ce0-5c73-b289-c540c4e50cea', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', NULL),
  ('b8110ae4-d90a-5e07-924a-a93dc3d2c063', '4d2eede5-c18d-57fa-b36b-8863e6580ae3', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(i) RHEMA, OAU, UNN, OOU, BENIN, EKSU and BOWEN do not accept Biology. | (ii) BOWEN do not accept Biology. | BOWEN same as in Biochemistry | UTME (i) BOWEN and IGBINEDION - do not accept Agricultural Science. | UTME SUBJECTS (i) BOWEN and PHC do not accept Agricultural Science. | AJAYI, IGBINEDION, IBADAN, BOWEN and BENIN as in Chemistry.'),
  ('66c77a76-1a1f-5f57-b521-0b86cb3b8f1d', '2a323993-11a4-5569-905d-e90b89ee3bc7', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(xix) BSU accepts NCE merit, ND upper credit in relevant programmes plus five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes at a sitting. | (iv) BSU requires ''O'' Level credit pass in Mathematics. | (xx) BSU requires Chemistry, Biology and any of Physics or Mathematics. | BSU accepts passes in five (5) prescribed subjects in Preliminary Science of BSU in addition to minimum UTME scores. It does not accept Agricultural Science in lieu of Biology. | BSU requires Chemistry, Biology and any of Physics or Mathematics.'),
  ('5cdf8272-fca1-52d3-8584-46950a5c6f8d', 'dc4f0a5d-b0bd-5a7a-84e2-a4406fe8dfd8', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(iii) CALABAR requires ''O'' Level credit pass in Physics /Mathematics. CALABAR accepts ''O'' Level D7 in English and one (1) of Mathematics or Biology.'),
