  ('ee9efbe2-f732-52a3-91f1-9f3e4d4c486f', '26ce26b0-5eac-5286-b8b5-179e56a6b320', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(iv) IBADAN, UNN, LAGOS and OAU do not accept ND/NCE. | (xlvii) LAGOS accepts (a) very good passes in the following three JUPEB/''A'' Level subjects: Chemistry, Physics and any one (1) of Mathematics and Biology. (b) Candidates must satisfy the UTME requirements. | (xi) LAGOS requires Chemistry, Physics and any of Biology or Mathematics. | LAGOS accepts Very good passes in the following three JUPEB/''A''-level subjects: Chemistry, Physics and any one (1) of Mathematics and Biology. Candidates must satisfy the UTME requirements. | LAGOS requires Five O/Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Biology, Chemistry and Physics. | LAGOS requires English Language, Chemistry, Physics and any of Biology or Mathematics.'),
