  ('ac5001ec-d1ad-54f2-b6ed-3d4f5d90ebe4', 'cd249c69-ed06-5a7c-bb7d-6a7b093fdd60', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', 'MCPHERSON accepts HND lower credit, ND upper credit in Chemistry, Physics, Biology and any other relevant programme. ''O'' Level credit passes in any two (2) of Biology, Physics and Mathematics in addition to ''A'' Level passes in Chemistry and Physics or Biology.'),
  ('34816e17-2e7d-5bb9-9337-1bd0b7014fb9', 'eb2b773f-8ee4-5799-ac95-143c6394f4d9', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(x) UDU, BAYERO, MAIDUGURI and LASU accept NCE Chemistry major.'),
  ('4aa15d99-346c-5f63-8473-a6d1ada05efc', 'c6fc829e-08df-5b24-ad29-f0fcd8e09a0b', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', 'MAKURDI accepts UTME requirements plus `A'' Level passes in Chemistry and one (1) other relevant Science subject may be admitted to 200 level. (b) HND upper credit in relevant programmes who possess the UTME requirements may also be admitted to the 200 level. (c) NCE with two (2) ''O'' Level credit passes in relevant subjects, which must include Chemistry, and those who possess the UTME requirements may be admitted to 200 level. | (xxii) MAKURDI accepts ''O'' Level credit passes in either Geography or Statistics in lieu of Biology.'),
  ('c1c7ce4c-de8c-5dd1-a5fc-51415bdef133', '43eded73-d8ee-57da-ba48-e8ea86c8fc90', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(v) MAUTY accepts IJMB/ Two (2) A level credit passes in Chemistry and any one (1) of Physics, Mathematics or Biology. ND/HND with a minimum of credit passes in relevant field. | (xlii) MAUTY accepts Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry and Biology. | (xvii) MAUTY requires Chemistry and Biology, Physics/Mathematics. | MAUTY accepts IJMB/ Two (2) A level passes in Chemistry and Mathematics. ND/HND in Science Technology or ND in relevant field. | MAUTY requires Chemistry, Physics and Biology. | MAUTY requires Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and Biology. | MAUTY requires Chemistry, Mathematics and any of Physics/Biology/ Agricultural Science.'),
  ('95098b0c-b848-5ee0-86e1-c7c9843643d2', 'bbb4456a-842d-5c68-b8df-52431f4f22b8', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(vi) MINNA accepts NCE credit and ND/HND lower credit in addition to ''O'' Level credit passes in Mathematics, Chemistry and two (2) other Science subjects. | MINNA accepts NCE credit, ND/HND lower credit in addition to ''O'' Level credit passes in Mathematics, Chemistry and two (2) other Science subjects. | (xxviii) MINNA requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry and any other two (2) subjects from Physics, Biology, Further Mathematics, Geography and Technical Drawing. | (ii) UNIKINGS, MINNA and UMUDIKE require Chemistry, Mathematics and either Physics or Biology.'),
  ('169e1bc8-0176-56ef-8414-22b238679d41', 'd0c97679-cbb1-5ace-86e9-36eb9efecde6', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', NULL),
