  ('ea35e46b-7ca8-577b-bc92-fce75b9f2a6b', '7aeec5b4-cf56-5d90-bfa4-3371a6f54bb9', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(lx) PHC accepts Two (2) A/level GCE or HSC or IJMB or JUPEB passes in Chemistry, Physics or Mathematics including UTME entry requirements. | (xv) PHC requires Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry and Biology. | (iv) FED-LAFIA, AUE, PHC and DELSU require Chemistry, Physics and Mathematics only. | (xxvii) PHC requires Chemistry, Mathematics, Physics. | PHC - For Pure and Industrial Chemistry accepts Two (2) A/level GCE or HSC or IJMB or JUPEB passes in Chemistry, Physics or Mathematics including UTME entry requirements. For Industrial Chemistry accepts Two (2) A/level GCE or HSC or IJMB or JUPEB passes in Chemistry, Physics or Mathematics including UTME entry requirements. | PHC - For Pure and Industrial Chemistry accepts Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and Biology. For Industrial Chemistry accepts Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and Biology. | UTME SUBJECTS (i) BOWEN and PHC do not accept Agricultural Science. | PHC - For both Industrial Chemistry and Pure and Industrial Chemistry requires Chemistry, Mathematics, Physics.'),
  ('1a2dc901-aefa-5f88-b4df-5559c2fab22c', 'bf0a9b2b-9fd6-5e7e-9c88-6c372119fa86', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(xlix) PLASU accepts a) degree in any programme provided the candidate meets the UTME requirements. b) HND lower credit in relevant programme, with the UTME requirements. c) ND lower credit in relevant programmes with the UTME requirements. d) IJMB minimum of seven (7) points with passes in relevant subjects, with the UTME requirements. e) PLASU does not accept University diplomas and other diplomas not accredited by the relevant accrediting bodies. | (xxxii) PLASU accepts Further Mathematics and Agricultural Science as Science subjects.'),
  ('fd54b25f-0f85-557c-9109-52156e823a72', 'c56fe7bf-62ad-5caf-bfa8-3228f9f222bd', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', NULL),
  ('ac009f26-6770-5eed-b8b9-58645013ae14', '7261a996-7c10-5b44-b848-58a6ecfe5a75', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', NULL),
  ('6ba69785-3ecd-5d3b-af28-541f9228e8db', '0a012370-5686-58d1-8d4e-296446853862', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(lv) RSU in addition to ''O'' Level requirements accepts: (a) HND (Lower Credit) in relevant discipline. (b) OND/ND (Upper Credit) in relevant discipline. (c) At least two (2) `A'' Level passes in Chemistry and either Biology or Physics. | (xix) RSU requires Chemistry, Mathematics and any other Science Subject.'),
