  ('0df7154f-0a88-50a9-b1be-f3795e772610', 'ac4a4889-8ec2-5a9f-adc6-7c1994f7f624', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(xvii) UMUDIKE require ''A'' Level passes in Chemistry and Mathematics or Physics. | (xx) UMUDIKE same as in Mathematics. | (ii) UNIKINGS, MINNA and UMUDIKE require Chemistry, Mathematics and either Physics or Biology.'),
  ('cb0892b1-ec0b-56bf-95cf-9bad403f688b', '03d64828-505a-54d5-8a8c-7a95c177ddb1', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', 'UMYUK accepts candidates with ND/HND lower credit in Chemistry as major or its equivalent from a recognized institution. NCE candidates must have Chemistry as a major with any of Physics, Biology, Mathematics or other relevant subjects or certificate from a recognized university with a minimum of nine (9) points. NCE Chemistry, Physics or Mathematics plus ''O'' Level credit pass in Mathematics | (xii) UMYUK requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes at not more than two (2) sittings, which must include English Language, Mathematics, Biology and Chemistry. | UMYUK accepts ND/HND lower credit with Chemistry as major or its equivalent lower credit from a recognized institution. NCE candidates must have Chemistry as major with any of Physics, Biology, Mathematics or other relevant subject or certificate from a recognized institution with a score of nine (9) points. ''A'' Level passes in Chemistry and any two (2) from Physics, Biology or Mathematics with a score of nine (9) points. | UMYUK accepts five (5) credit passes at SSC or its equivalent in English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and any of Biology, Geography, Agricultural Science or Computer Studies at not more than two (2) sittings. | UMYUK requires Chemistry and any other two (2) Science subjects.'),
  ('0cfbe244-ceb9-50d4-ac4e-08935f7074c1', '0087c5c8-6db1-50fa-a425-7466b9f64e30', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', NULL),
  ('c04c6f29-e8f9-5990-a510-6e58a126f41b', 'a730598e-66a9-598b-b62c-fce460622715', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(l) UNIKINGS as in Biochemistry. | (xxxiv) UNIKINGS as in Biochemistry | (ii) UNIKINGS, MINNA and UMUDIKE require Chemistry, Mathematics and either Physics or Biology.'),
  ('29fe0cd5-ec86-5828-9120-d5608a19b33a', '511f36cd-22bd-5e2a-accf-432b24ea59dd', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', 'UNIOSUN accepts ''A'' Level passes in Biology, Geography and Physics in lieu of Mathematics. ND lower credit or approved equivalents. | UNIOSUN and EBSU require Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry.'),
  ('63771040-288c-5278-a707-4ac8be0016da', '76561787-b77a-53e2-a65c-22d345d89260', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', '(xv) UYO accepts ND upper credit and HND lower credit in relevant programmes plus the UTME requirements. | (xi) UYO requires ''O'' Level credit pass in English Language'),
  ('a57c2226-01c5-5aa5-aacd-35ca13c58a08', '82191620-27f8-59df-a08e-e53415df52b9', '7cc8cb7b-c778-52e8-8203-a1cba35e5eba', NULL),
