  ('007c8414-3441-5e46-8ab3-d90f6f485a38', 'b2c7e8cf-ee09-5ad3-8156-921b71bdcacd', '95470556-be8e-524a-84c9-c18631726722', 'Same as in Biodiversity Conservation and Utilization Level IJAMB/NCE/ND or its approved equivalent in Botany, Zoology, Biology and Chemistry. Also accepts IJMB and ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics or Geography at acceptable grades; ND, HND or its equivalent in Agricultural Science or Civil Engineering or related programmes provided UTME requirements have been met for 200 level.'),
