  ('7f26503f-26fb-50b6-952b-b49829c2c33f', '4f7c4462-fc92-5e4d-898e-e719fc70022b', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('61e4b4e7-31b3-505c-b530-070f54177386', 'ba376cf4-2fa0-5d7e-bc62-a6f184d76b46', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('44f1a2ee-42f0-5867-a570-adccd1b48204', '136057a7-8b4b-5065-a6c8-67c8adf1127a', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'Accept ND/HND in relevant programmes. (UTME: also accept ''O'' Level pass in English Language, with UNIZIK).'),
  ('7ec90116-1bac-591c-a773-60864ea67936', '71d4e68b-6f91-57ef-9fa0-0337e3b0ee08', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('da0aebf1-d386-5e14-88a9-36de08fcd55f', '862dfbdf-bc8b-58e0-9031-c4c30cb2b315', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'Accept Mathematics, Physics and two (2) other Science subjects. CRUTECH UTME requires Mathematics, Physics and any of Biology, Chemistry and Geography.'),
  ('a96cb5a8-d9af-54c2-92b6-d932c22f416b', 'b2c7e8cf-ee09-5ad3-8156-921b71bdcacd', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'Requires either Physics or Chemistry in addition to Mathematics and also IJMB at acceptable grade levels. UTME accepts Geography.'),
  ('72e6305d-2dc5-56ed-bc88-60e1b02a3212', '6b2054f3-00a0-5971-bbf3-b1e0b6187ef5', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('632c91f9-e7ce-5f0b-a0f4-88747acc61c2', '6c027f7b-a8c6-5ca0-9e34-7004461a873e', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('6ce821ee-e5ff-5669-818f-e9318f44b24d', '32ed37ab-c7e4-5072-af80-ce3659ab6a7b', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: requires ''A'' Level passes which must include Mathematics and a Science subject. O''level: accepts five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes which must include English Language, Mathematics and any two (2) of Physics, Chemistry, Biology and Further Mathematics. UTME: requires Mathematics and any two (2) of Physics, Chemistry and Biology.'),
  ('6b504b2f-688e-578b-a025-aa27348cc515', '8ad8b817-0045-5081-8f1d-af80ae4f1e41', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('e8ab3c1f-bd82-5216-ac1d-edea808aeacd', '10bd0a2d-120a-58eb-8c39-c9ce5ab0a925', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('d06f132e-9089-5faa-8955-89044e20e2fe', 'e7c6659e-a0dc-560a-943f-4ec52c0df473', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('932a91b1-37db-532c-9b90-cdda0c85f09b', '2eeb38d3-f2b6-5e5f-8495-08af1af1d88e', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('a6436953-6b14-5eb6-9f7a-8ae436eb50b8', '7543ae81-5433-5429-ba08-51e6559b634f', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: (a) Two (2) ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics and any other Science subject; (b) NCE with at least Merit in Mathematics and one of Physics, Chemistry or Economics; (c) OND/HND with credit passes from a recognised institution in addition to ''O'' Level requirements; (d) Very good passes in JUPEB in Biology, Chemistry and Physics; (e) IJMB passes in Biology, Chemistry, Physics and Mathematics. O''level: requires five (5) credit passes at SSC or equivalent including English Language, Mathematics and Physics or Chemistry.'),
  ('58d0ca30-dc7e-567d-a233-604aac478439', '913f5f60-e942-5cf3-bf5e-17c222e3a8e7', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('bc8dad08-433f-5990-b6c1-e4cfb09b4b6c', 'ee44316c-07fd-5ce2-93dc-a98a8095998d', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DIRECT ENTRY: accept Mathematics and Physics or Chemistry. EKSU does not accept NCE for Direct Entry. | Accept Mathematics and Physics or Chemistry. EKSU does not accept NCE for Direct Entry. | Do not accept NCE. | Requires ''O'' Level pass in Chemistry. UTME requires Physics.'),
  ('b9c676a6-2cde-5dc4-b828-8efd1b715188', 'd3a418de-b72b-5553-b672-82cfbccacf14', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('88cce154-4615-57c1-ac4c-2d6b15092f80', '8f0b6aa4-f525-540f-a351-ddb51bd3421a', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('09aa43e2-ba60-5f61-8ee6-df9c99da5dcc', 'd567a2a1-0e09-50e6-a549-8ebc1a86367d', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: requires the second ''A'' Level pass to be either Physics or Chemistry; does not accept Economics as a Science subject. O''level: accepts ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics and any three (3) subjects in the following order: Further Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, Biology and Agricultural Science. UTME: accepts Biology as one (1) of the two (2) other subjects.'),
  ('b33d4df9-2a08-5c49-ad2a-6ee5bc7bf3e4', '75eaf007-a369-56a4-a009-832b8a0efd89', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: in addition to ''O'' Level requirement, accepts two (2) ''A'' level passes (at GCE ''A'' Level, NCE, IJMB or ND) in Mathematics and any other relevant science subject with minimum of eight (8) points where applicable, accepts ND credit and IJMB with minimum of eight (8) points. O''level: requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes at SSC level or equivalent to include English Language, Mathematics, Physics and any other two relevant Science subjects in not more than two sittings. UTME: accepts Mathematics, and any two subjects from Physics, Chemistry, Economics, Biology, Geography and Agricultural Science. | Requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes at SSC level or equivalent to include English Language, Mathematics, Physics and any other two relevant Science subjects in not more than two sittings.'),
  ('26c2e683-abad-5b8e-884f-94192da5f638', '4b90c4e5-c0ba-525e-9663-8fe5ce07e7c5', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: requires Two ''A'' level passes in Mathematics and any one of Physics, Chemistry, Economics or Geography; NCE with at least Merit in Mathematics and one of Physics, Chemistry or Economics; or ND with good grades and relevant ''O'' Level subjects. O''level: requires Five ''O'' level Credits including English Language, Mathematics and Physics and any other two subjects from Chemistry, Biology, Economics or Geography. UTME: accepts English Language, Mathematics, Physics and any of Chemistry, Economics or Geography.'),
  ('a694e14e-5770-5832-aa13-1926255828c6', 'df55ed4b-dcd1-522b-985b-afd17113826f', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: requires ''A'' Level passes or equivalent with passes in Mathematics and one of Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Geography and Economics; HND (Lower credit) in Mathematics and any of Statistics, Physics, Computer Science and Engineering; and NCE with at least merit in Mathematics and one of Physics, Chemistry or Economics and any other Science Subjects; IJMB 6 points admitted to 200 Level. O''level: requires five (5) credit passes including English Language, Mathematics, Physics and any two (2) of Chemistry, Further Mathematics, Economics, Geography or Agricultural Science. UTME: accepts Mathematics, Physics and any of Chemistry/Biology/Economics/Geography.'),
  ('334f1182-0861-56ab-8bcf-784638338438', 'b1fafa11-fd80-5f90-8d8b-e7c1d5f7f763', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('25ed2838-e8eb-5f58-b8ad-ea4d5a934670', 'cc548faf-07a4-5541-93c3-535da80d4d5e', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: accepts ND/NCE in Computer Science/Mathematics with at least Lower Credit pass and not below 9 points with any of Mathematics (for Comp. Sci. and vice versa), Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Geography or credit passes in IJMB with Mathematics and Physics as core and any other subject from Chemistry, Biology and Geography with minimum of 9 points. O''level: accepts Five credit passes at SSCE (or equivalent) in English, Mathematics, Physics, and any other two relevant Science Subjects from ICT/Computer Studies, Chemistry and Biology/Agricultural Science, Geography and Further Mathematics. UTME: requires Mathematics, Physics, and one of Biology/Agriculture, Chemistry, & Geography.'),
  ('6e676b50-d083-56f3-9390-b9fc93d0d200', '4b767c85-a5d3-5578-b266-246db57463f3', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('a56f312c-59a9-5341-a91a-6f6018a5a2aa', '7f1e09fa-66eb-50d0-b12b-a66eecc30366', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: in addition to UTME requirements, DE candidates must have any of: IJMB minimum of 9 points in Mathematics and any two of Physics, Chemistry, Geography or Biology; NCE Merit in Mathematics and any of Physics, Geography, Chemistry, Biology and Agric. Science; ND not less than lower Credit/HND in any relevant course. O''level: requires Five (5) Credit passes at SSCE, GCE, NECO and NABTEB O''Level in Mathematics, English Language, Biology, Agric. Science, or Further Mathematics, Chemistry and Physics, in not more than two sittings. UTME: requires Mathematics, Chemistry and Physics; also requires Mathematics and any two (2) of Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Economics or Geography.'),
  ('86c17b66-e3f6-5de5-82ff-7d81ebc53329', '363063fa-a46e-5ffa-82be-96d75945a3b9', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: in addition to UTME Entry Requirements; 2 A'' Level Passes to include Mathematics and any one of Physics, Geography, Chemistry, Biology, Economics or Statistics; IJMB minimum of 9 points with passes in relevant subjects; NCE Credit Pass in Mathematics and any other relevant subject combination; ND upper credit in Statistics or Computer Science; HND lower credit in Mathematics or any other relevant combination; Degree (Third Class) relevant courses. O''level: requires Five SSC credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Physics and any two of Chemistry, Further Mathematics, Geography or Biology/Agricultural Science. UTME: requires Mathematics, Physics and any of Chemistry/Biology/Agricultural Science.'),
  ('86e1e9bf-ee6e-5f6c-8b8e-9280ac849a72', 'a7537f3d-dd55-5419-9e59-c906e666b2e9', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('4328e876-df93-5ec4-9e73-4cf5990769bc', 'cf90707a-389f-5ef7-9550-3e51de569ee2', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('7aef9121-d929-5c5d-81a1-1e0f65a1aa73', 'cd4edfad-172a-5f76-b45e-f806306ef788', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: (a) two (2) ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics and any other of Physics and Chemistry; (b) minimum of upper credit in OND/NCE Mathematics/Statistics from recognized Polytechnic or College of Education. O''level: requires five (5) credits passes including English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry and Biology. UTME: accepts Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry.'),
  ('2599a4ec-bae3-54e9-8e8c-d39796ee112c', '494e4fb9-006d-55e9-86f2-caf559cdfb7d', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: candidates must obtain at least two A/Level passes in Science subject one of which must be Mathematics at GCE A/Level/IJMB/Advanced NABTEB or at least a Merit Pass at NCE or at least a Lower Credit in OND/HND in Mathematics; must also satisfy O/L requirements. O''level: requires Five (5) Credits at not more than two sittings including English Language, Mathematics and Physics and any Two from Chemistry, Biology, Further Mathematics and Geography from SSCE/NECO/NABTEB or equivalent. UTME: requires Mathematics and any two of Physics/Chemistry/Economics/Geography.'),
  ('a0c80d9f-037d-55d8-b2f1-b3843f729883', '83fac53f-1976-54e9-8d52-216198517c81', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('25a42df7-cb98-5073-88ba-d8721415a276', '7062e9a0-2192-54f6-b5b6-b4c3d232415f', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('363286b8-f3d8-564e-8e96-d794368ff544', 'ff56eafd-175e-5821-960d-0229798b6980', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('8307c525-0d01-55a6-98cb-e3d63bbe396a', '9462539f-d63e-59e0-84d5-82dfb6184f69', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'Same as in Physics. O''level: requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and Biology. UTME (with UNIOSUN, FED-LAFIA, LASU, IGBINEDION, OAU): require Mathematics, Chemistry and Physics.'),
  ('b748e91c-0bba-54b5-bac8-2d7d7df6acec', '557c215c-aec4-5e78-9bcd-076cf7bf585b', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: requires two (2) A Level passes in Mathematics and any other science subject. O''level: requires five (5) SSC credit passes including English Language, Mathematics, Physics and any other two subjects from Chemistry, Computer Studies, Biology/Agricultural Science or Data Processing/GSM Maintenance. UTME: requires Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry or Biology/Agricultural Science.'),
  ('1097a2cb-302d-5f9b-949e-c0a3a8f13a3c', '2a117a94-b271-5351-a623-6616184fe452', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: (a) ND with minimum of Upper Credit or equivalent in Mathematics and Statistics, Physics Electronics and Computer Science from recognized Polytechnics and Colleges of Technology; (b) GCE (''A'' Level) or equivalent with passes in Mathematics and any of Physics, Chemistry and Computer Science; (d) very good passes in three JUPEB subjects namely Chemistry, Physics and Mathematics, does not accept NCE, candidates must in addition meet the ''O'' Level requirements. O''level: requires five (5) SSC credit passes or equivalent at a maximum of two (2) sittings in English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry and one other science subject. UTME: requires Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry.'),
  ('bf58ee39-2610-5e1a-97fb-4d8ec57b7a4e', 'a9560228-6453-5527-8eb6-9f5c346fabb0', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: at least two (2) ''A'' level passes not below Grade C in Mathematics and Physics; ND/HND at Upper Credit level in Physics, Mathematics, Statistics, Chemistry, Computer Science, Geology or Engineering; First Degree in Physics, Mathematics, Statistics, Chemistry, Computer Science, Geology or Engineering. O''level: requires at least five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and any other science subject in not more than two (2) sittings; at least a Pass is required in Biology. UTME: requires Mathematics, Chemistry and Physics.'),
  ('ef0f2b6b-7a81-5d55-92bb-b3196ce53019', '73700bdc-7a5a-5ba5-887e-0e86a917f1ba', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'Same as in Biological Sciences.'),
  ('dc4115cc-552d-55bd-b8b6-8ad9090207ed', 'a5195c43-ccd6-5078-b2ce-57a1cf6df45e', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('c1872572-e49d-5ece-8e2c-7e7342d052fa', 'f3d31093-b900-5185-a4ef-b3dbb37cb373', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('5d36cad9-cbd4-54c4-ab53-543bd9661e69', '8c9295db-6a52-50d5-a409-7821d70fd2cd', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DIRECT ENTRY: accept Mathematics and Physics or Chemistry. EKSU does not accept NCE for Direct Entry. | Accept Mathematics and Physics or Chemistry. EKSU does not accept NCE for Direct Entry.'),
  ('659afa4e-a379-5f40-bf08-dae910a4f82c', '90dc9158-7948-5e3d-878c-169deaeb2191', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('4c73f59a-4f71-5214-b6b2-689f40baed12', 'bfca5adf-5941-53e6-8131-2591eb68f748', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('f823bde1-78c9-5383-ba48-258457ea8b7b', '874cb3e9-b034-5191-b74e-cb4647665403', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: accepts at least two (2) ''A'' level passes in Science subjects to include Mathematics, Physics and or Chemistry or at least (2) NCE credit passes in Mathematics and Physics or Mathematics and another Science subject or Economics. O''level: requires minimum of five (5) ordinary level passes at not more than two sittings at ''O'' level GCE/WAEC/SSCE/NECO to include English, Mathematics and any other three subjects from Further Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Computer Studies and Agricultural Science. UTME: requires English, Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry or Biology.'),
  ('20aa48e3-cbc8-5451-a122-6ac71d8a2df2', 'e1c071b0-e046-51f0-9de7-77ac53886688', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: accepts two (2) ''A'' Level passes including Mathematics and any Science subject OR NCE merit in Mathematics and one (1) other approved Science subject. O''level: requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes including English Language, Mathematics and any two (2)/three (3) of Biology, Chemistry, Physics, Further Mathematics or Geography and other subject as the 6th subject. UTME: requires Mathematics and any other two (2) Science subjects excluding Agricultural Science.'),
  ('a01ddf6e-b096-5a33-b2ca-780cc1e2baa8', 'be4981eb-2b54-5ea1-941d-44e8ca2774db', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: accepts at least ''A'' level passes or equivalent in Mathematics and any one of Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Geography and Economics. O''level: requires five (5) ''O'' level credit passes including Mathematics, English Language, Physics and any two of Chemistry, Biology, Economics, Geography, Further Mathematics. UTME: accepts Biology, Mathematics and Physics; also requires Mathematics, Physics and any one of Chemistry, Biology, Economics and Geography.'),
  ('e1c8f57d-67f1-5550-bf2a-27afc6b3a2b2', '308b7f5a-13c7-5fc0-8c29-5cac2ac5d469', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'No Direct Entry Admission. ABSU accepts ND upper credit and HND lower credit plus the UTME requirements. UTME: IMSU and ABSU require Physics; IMSU accepts ''O'' Level pass in English Language. ABSU requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes including English Language, Mathematics and Physics or Chemistry and any two (2) subjects. | Accept English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, and any other relevant Science subject.'),
  ('151f0650-3650-5d8e-871c-c78fa9bdf62a', '6b1e4004-5797-54ff-be1c-de4a290601f3', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('902913a4-3f1a-5d62-97a5-c5e25d6a2859', 'bfdc5e48-20b3-5e9d-b4f7-3b1ab0d35bc3', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('902cbacf-e10c-5d87-a265-2064268f1efc', 'e6c3392c-accc-5515-a9ce-560b9790aede', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'Accept ND upper credit in Computer Science. JOS does not accept ND in Computer Science and Statistics, Geography and Mathematics. MAUTY DE: accepts two (2) A level credit passes in Mathematics and any of Physics, Chemistry, Economics or Geography; ND/HND/NCE in Computer Science, Mathematics, Mathematics Education or Statistics at lower credit level; IJMB with minimum of 8 points including credit pass in Mathematics. MAUTY O''level: requires five (5) SSC credit passes including English Language, Mathematics and Physics and any two of Chemistry, Further Mathematics, Biology/Agric. Science, Geography, Economics, Basic Electricity/Electronics, Computer Studies/IT/Data processing. MAUTY UTME: requires Mathematics and any two (2) of Physics, Chemistry, Economics, Biology/Agric Science. | Does not accept ND in Computer Science and Statistics, Geography and Mathematics.'),
  ('2efc76b5-0dac-5ae9-b410-02ec07e2b12b', 'accf0ac6-2d45-515e-99a3-226d5e64b71a', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: accepts Two ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics and Physics; NCE merit in Mathematics and any of Physics, Statistics, Chemistry; ND/HND Lower Credit in related field; 7 points in IJMB; in addition to ''O'' Level requirements. O''level: requires Five ''O'' level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Physics and two other science subjects. UTME: requires Physics; does not accept Economics and Agricultural Science; requires Mathematics, Physics and one other Science subject.'),
  ('60583945-0b55-57ec-8deb-609fc1f1c74c', '75621c96-8f52-5845-abef-3095b9bee383', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
