  ('bf2653d8-ee7e-53ed-b3dd-15e9e014eb19', 'eb2b773f-8ee4-5799-ac95-143c6394f4d9', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'Accept ND/HND in relevant programmes. (UTME: also accept ''O'' Level pass in English Language, with UNIZIK). | UTME requires Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry/Biology.'),
