  ('9fd0fcdb-2e82-577f-bf59-c66b2fd5227c', 'b85995c1-4fe5-5833-896c-e58f8ae25106', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('d5f92d68-d091-51c1-9cb0-54392f968f2b', '43eded73-d8ee-57da-ba48-e8ea86c8fc90', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'Accept ND upper credit in Computer Science. JOS does not accept ND in Computer Science and Statistics, Geography and Mathematics. MAUTY DE: accepts two (2) A level credit passes in Mathematics and any of Physics, Chemistry, Economics or Geography; ND/HND/NCE in Computer Science, Mathematics, Mathematics Education or Statistics at lower credit level; IJMB with minimum of 8 points including credit pass in Mathematics. MAUTY O''level: requires five (5) SSC credit passes including English Language, Mathematics and Physics and any two of Chemistry, Further Mathematics, Biology/Agric. Science, Geography, Economics, Basic Electricity/Electronics, Computer Studies/IT/Data processing. MAUTY UTME: requires Mathematics and any two (2) of Physics, Chemistry, Economics, Biology/Agric Science. | DE: accepts Two (2) A level credit passes in Mathematics and any of Physics, Chemistry, Economics or Geography; ND/HND/NCE in Computer science, mathematics, Mathematics Education or Statistics at lower credit level; IJMB minimum of 8 points including credit pass in Mathematics.'),
  ('ffc6ce9a-d488-52b2-9817-7ce3146bdad3', 'cd249c69-ed06-5a7c-bb7d-6a7b093fdd60', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'Accepts ''A'' Level passes/NCE/ND/HND or approved equivalent in Mathematics and any one (1) of Biology, Chemistry, Economics, Statistics and Physics. Also accepts ''A'' Level/ND upper credit/HND lower credit or its equivalent in Mathematics and any one (1) of Biology, Chemistry, Economics, Statistics and Physics. | Accepts ''A'' Level/ND upper credit/HND lower credit or its equivalent in Mathematics and any one (1) of Biology, Chemistry, Economics, Statistics and Physics.'),
  ('cdc1509d-8ad6-5ae2-bd5d-6746ce5021ff', 'd0c97679-cbb1-5ace-86e9-36eb9efecde6', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('d2e1d19d-32eb-50e1-bc6d-7fd6f5a56cb3', '7e84d3fa-36a7-5f8b-899e-ea626b19e5f1', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('2d052bf4-f4d0-573f-8f5b-74e4f0563320', '357b584e-b53b-5cb4-9f49-aa8ae157f2de', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: in addition to ''O'' level requirements accepts: (a) two ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics and at least one of Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Economics or Geography; (b) good NCE certificate with Mathematics and any Science subject as teaching subjects (pass at distinction or credit level); (c) OND with at least distinction or upper credit; (d) Foundation/JUPEB from Mountain Top University or other recognized Universities. O''level (for Mathematics with Computer Science): requires five (5) credit passes at SSC or equivalent to include English Language, Mathematics, Physics and any of Chemistry, Biology, Economics, Geography. UTME: accepts Mathematics, Physics and any one of Chemistry or Economics/Geography/Biology/Agricultural Science.'),
