  ('4029bb11-749c-589e-ade7-7d95f536cbdb', 'c75ad46b-847c-552b-827e-8e77808d9762', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: (a) NCE merit in Mathematics or ND in Statistics; (b) NCE/ND/HND credit in related programme. O''level: requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics and at least three (3) subjects from Physics, Statistics, Chemistry, Further Mathematics, Economics and Geography. UTME (with OAUSTECH): require Mathematics, Physics and any one (1) of Chemistry or Biology. | UTME requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics and at least three (3) subjects from Physics, Statistics, Chemistry, Further Mathematics, Economics and Geography.'),
