  ('1e3d3f3e-5294-541c-b246-e24268ba26cc', '01d84636-8fcb-525c-87bf-9dc57b202dc2', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('6a25d10a-16e4-59cc-b646-910af7763f82', '1390bf59-701d-5cae-851e-e3f8fcf171d9', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('07e94978-1d0a-5ddd-8fca-94dcb199ddc4', '7f7ca858-2c72-5e58-90c0-37428e659588', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: accepts NCE merit and ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics and any other Science subject, Statistics or Computer Science in addition to the UTME requirements. O''level: accepts ''O'' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics and at least two (2) of Physics, Chemistry, Statistics, Economics, Geography and Further Mathematics. UTME: accepts Mathematics and any two (2) of Physics, Chemistry, Economics, Biology and Agricultural Science.'),
  ('3b0605df-70d0-59b1-94cd-7b5e520c416b', 'e98b5d0e-effb-53f7-aec2-8485199a5b5c', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('5bc32ea2-545f-583f-a243-ed5110676f42', 'a8615ddc-26f0-5d2b-ba4e-b49c545b0163', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('9074a9c2-07e2-5a4c-aad4-7e735bee870d', 'b142037f-159e-5166-9da1-a41ab005569c', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'Accept ND credit in Computer Science or any other Mathematics-based subject.'),
  ('bea192da-2cf5-58cd-9e1e-40c025e16d15', 'ac4a4889-8ec2-5a9f-adc6-7c1994f7f624', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'Requires ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics and Physics. Accepts ND upper credit, HND to 200 level. O''level: requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes at not more than two (2) sittings to include English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and any other relevant Science subject. UTME: requires Mathematics and any two (2) of Physics, Chemistry and Geography or Economics.'),
  ('3ee16340-4bf9-5d15-95fb-bcc21fc2c19a', '03d64828-505a-54d5-8a8c-7a95c177ddb1', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: accepts a minimum of 9 points in IJMB/HSC/GCE ''A'' Level/NCE, in Mathematics and any of Physics or Chemistry; candidates with minimum of lower credit pass in ND/HND in Mathematics may also be admitted. O''level: requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes at SSC or equivalent in English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, and any of Biology, Agricultural Science, Geography, Computer Studies/ICT or Further Mathematics at not more than two (2) sittings. UTME: requires Mathematics, Physics and any other Science subject.'),
  ('750c96ef-da13-5c62-b989-dc1dcd09a1a8', '0087c5c8-6db1-50fa-a425-7466b9f64e30', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('1b9f65f5-1073-5824-938c-f57bcef7862e', '38612fa1-5efb-53b3-ab6b-a218f34449e3', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('dfbc675a-44b8-565f-ae9c-571cd33453ca', '14be5fe8-f55e-5851-a1df-21d97796e5d2', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('d2cfcbe0-dda4-5e7b-a98d-d01e822a13e0', '511f36cd-22bd-5e2a-accf-432b24ea59dd', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: accepts two (2) ''A'' Level passes in Mathematics and other science subject from Physics and Chemistry. O''level (with PLASU): requires five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes including English Language, Mathematics, Physics to form the core subjects, with ''O'' Level credit passes in two (2) other relevant Science subjects at not more than two (2) sittings. | Accept English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, and any other relevant Science subject.'),
  ('39fd6114-d545-5c3c-99fa-14cc750acf77', '3a9f0243-a4ff-53cc-aa6f-bc01c43451d7', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'UTME: accepts Economics in lieu of Physics/Chemistry; requires ''O'' Level pass in English Language (with COOU, MAIDUGURI); does not accept Geography (with PHC).'),
  ('44124117-d5ac-54e5-b19d-d87e3502412f', 'a730598e-66a9-598b-b62c-fce460622715', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'DE: (a) two (2) ''A'' Level passes in science subjects including Mathematics and Physics; (b) NCE with at least Merit in Mathematics and Physics and one other Science or Social Science subject. O''level: accepts five (5) credits in SSC in English Language, Mathematics, Physics and any two (2) of Further Mathematics, Chemistry, Biology, Agriculture. UTME: requires Mathematics, Physics and any of Biology, Chemistry or Agricultural Science. | Accepts two (2) ''A'' Level passes in Science subjects including Mathematics and Physics; also accepts NCE with at least Merit in Mathematics and Physics and one other Science or Social Science subject.'),
  ('0d268407-48b2-5b23-8677-13ca4706752f', 'f90909a4-fcc6-5899-a1a5-dd43ce3cbbc8', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
  ('10597409-b965-503f-a10b-a3fccf1c9ffe', '76561787-b77a-53e2-a65c-22d345d89260', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', 'Accepts ND/HND in relevant programmes plus the UTME requirements. O''level: requires ''O'' Level credit passes in Mathematics and Physics. | Requires ''O'' Level credit passes in Mathematics and Physics.'),
  ('5ff57141-f356-56e8-b33d-6361831d9829', '82191620-27f8-59df-a08e-e53415df52b9', '5e4428c5-9417-5d43-8c8c-896d2d2d9266', NULL),
