  ('537a9c1d-45d6-578a-b490-27ed5ee74111', 'e8c6808a-0849-5b97-9a52-9ee5acde35cd', 'a3ee8b52-f45a-562a-9f13-437e335f7229', '(iii) BINGHAM and IBADAN require NCE/ND credit/merit in Mathematics and one (1) other approved Science subject.'),
