  ('6e08c3b8-ed96-5ed8-995e-69bbd272da5a', '75eaf007-a369-56a4-a009-832b8a0efd89', 'c4b7c032-1249-5ba3-944f-317e7f02690f', 'accepts National Diploma (ND) Minimum of Lower Credit in relevant programmes which must include Science Laboratory Technology, Marine Biology, Fisheries etc. IJMB minimum of eight (8) points with at least a ''D'' grade in Biology and Chemistry. NCE total of Eight (8) points. Accepts five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes at SSC or its equivalent to include Biology, Chemistry, Mathematics, English and any other Science subjects such as Physics, Geography, Animal Husbandry etc. | accepts English, Mathematics, Biology, Chemistry and Physics or Geography in SSC or its equivalent with minimum credit level in one or two sittings. | UTME SUBJECTS: accepts Biology, Chemistry and Physics.'),
