  ('b83d0ab9-4171-5890-adac-964935502bda', 'd27d7d4c-dcf3-5254-9faa-94e2991a92e3', '017ce18b-858a-54ec-a868-66509b88f6df', 'ABU accepts Two ''A'' level/IJMB passes in Geology and any other science subject (Chemistry, Physics, Mathematics, Biology, Botany, Zoology and Geography. | ABU requires Five ''O'' level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Biology, Chemistry and Physics.'),
