  ('2d6b1e71-5f73-573e-bcaf-a4c31677bf74', 'd27d7d4c-dcf3-5254-9faa-94e2991a92e3', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', '(xii) ABU accepts Two `A'' level/IJMB passes which must include Biology or Botany or Zoology and Chemistry in addition to O/L requirements.'),
  ('5538984e-779d-55b4-a457-bfd07a75655f', 'f6af7877-ccd2-5bd5-923d-ffd341d8e795', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', '(iii) AUE –HND and ND upper credit. | (iii) AUE and BSU require ''A'' Level pass in Biology/Botany/Zoology plus Chemistry/Physics.'),
  ('57a4f9f9-b52a-5851-8cfb-5a67dce96820', '2efe249d-d745-5228-b7ce-a9d51f310389', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', '(xi) AUGUSTINE accepts two (2) ''A'' Level passes in Biology, Botany, Zoology and Chemistry or Physics. NCE and ND credit in addition to five (5) ''O'' Level credit passes or its equivalent.'),
  ('78d493b9-0cb0-52ef-b9a5-db1eae52bea4', 'd3c7007f-2487-5d89-9eea-b6105c041044', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', NULL),
  ('90add9a7-c378-59a0-be7c-8709b7fd084f', '2a323993-11a4-5569-905d-e90b89ee3bc7', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', '(iii) AUE and BSU require ''A'' Level pass in Biology/Botany/Zoology plus Chemistry/Physics.'),
  ('5c328af0-41b1-5364-ac5b-10e99eaa1e19', '136057a7-8b4b-5065-a6c8-67c8adf1127a', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', NULL),
  ('92f1ec51-f197-53f0-80ca-095411158a3e', '862dfbdf-bc8b-58e0-9031-c4c30cb2b315', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', NULL),
  ('b408cab1-5663-5c95-8002-4e0590714077', 'ee44316c-07fd-5ce2-93dc-a98a8095998d', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', NULL),
  ('5b4d5976-7b8e-5c4d-ab2e-a1e682442d9c', '9462539f-d63e-59e0-84d5-82dfb6184f69', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', '(i) FUNAAB accepts a) ND upper credit in Biological Science, Science Laboratory Technology or related programmes. b) NCE credit in Biology. c) Two (2) ''A'' Level passes in Chemistry, Biology/Botany/Zoology, Physics and Mathematics.'),
  ('2a50d762-85a6-54e0-bd46-2249ceecf8bf', 'a9560228-6453-5527-8eb6-9f5c346fabb0', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', '(x) FUTO requires; a) At least two (2) `A'' Level passes not below Grade C in Chemistry and Biology. b) ND/HND at Upper Credit level in life sciences. c) First Degree in life sciences. d) Very good passes in three JUPEB subjects namely Chemistry, Biology and Physics. It does not accept NCE. Candidates must in addition meet the `O'' Level requirements.'),
  ('219155d4-6201-5ca5-8c5c-bbd7715a6745', '8c9295db-6a52-50d5-a409-7821d70fd2cd', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', NULL),
  ('a889fabb-ab6e-574d-83a4-7892e7fd5b68', '73700bdc-7a5a-5ba5-887e-0e86a917f1ba', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', NULL),
  ('a9b806bc-f612-5504-9a24-7719ae4c58dd', '4913ae25-7ae4-5cfc-a549-8bf1e09f6d97', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', NULL),
  ('1acf02c6-7d32-5af4-a54e-9af61dbe2307', 'accf0ac6-2d45-515e-99a3-226d5e64b71a', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', '(xiii) KASU accepts Two `A'' level passes to include one of Biology, Zoology or Chemistry. ND/HND/NCE in related field with a minimum of Lower Credits in addition to `O'' Level requirements. IJMB/GCE `A'' Level with a minimum of 7 Points and above in Biology, Chemistry, Zoology and Botany.'),
  ('9b11497e-fedf-5ef5-ba83-937fdeb6488f', '43eded73-d8ee-57da-ba48-e8ea86c8fc90', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', '(viii) MAUTY accepts (a) two (2) ''A'' Level passes in Biology and Chemistry (b) HND lower credit in relevant programme.'),
  ('7bcaf68f-8d14-58d2-88a1-baf4106654b9', '1c45a50a-ca0e-54eb-9f35-3be6de7b2e83', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', NULL),
  ('51215fb5-9daf-5ae5-8d56-3cc501d50c9f', 'bfd398ad-cc0f-5245-bf71-04505c05d507', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', '(vii) NDU accepts ND/HND and AIMLT including general ''A'' Level requirements.'),
  ('5120b265-5953-578a-a924-e90dba5d238e', 'e7c05fd4-6b0d-50f2-9179-d7c7be0a45a1', '1ff950fd-bd82-5844-8b39-9a4da052d231', NULL),
