  ('a62ced5a-f949-5b9b-b0b2-5f412f113808', '8c9295db-6a52-50d5-a409-7821d70fd2cd', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', 'Accepts Economics and Government (DE); accepts Economics (UTME).'),
  ('be92a825-0c19-5dcc-9f10-fd3d33110831', 'e1c071b0-e046-51f0-9de7-77ac53886688', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', 'DIRECT ENTRY: accepts two (2) ''A'' Level subjects including Geography and any other Science subject for Geography. UTME: five (5) or six (6) ''O'' Level credit passes at one (1) or two (2) sittings to include English Language, Mathematics, Geography, and any two (2) other Science subjects. UTME SUBJECTS: Mathematics/Biology, Chemistry/Physics, Further Mathematics or Geography.'),
  ('3e0e5668-5c44-5c1b-9c5d-3082e8c8ad78', 'accf0ac6-2d45-515e-99a3-226d5e64b71a', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', 'DIRECT ENTRY: Two ''A'' Level passes in Geography and any one of Economics, Physics, Chemistry and Biology. ND/HND/NCE Geography Lower Credit plus ''O'' Level requirements and IJMB with 7 Points. UTME: Five ''O'' level credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Geography and two other Science subjects; only accepts among Chemistry, Biology or Physics as the other two Science subjects. UTME SUBJECTS: Geography and two other Science subjects that may include Agric. Science.'),
  ('1089950c-ff9a-5195-904f-dc817bed3d57', '75621c96-8f52-5845-abef-3095b9bee383', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', NULL),
