  ('e46aaa49-a007-503d-ab52-a76af8d770b4', '97cc25e7-b0b9-542d-8da4-a78fa4f017bc', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', NULL),
  ('d86b2f9c-95de-5fee-986f-907de913875b', '03d64828-505a-54d5-8a8c-7a95c177ddb1', 'b71ed565-d14f-5c9b-9d3a-e87ba7673e46', 'Accepts a minimum of 9 points in IJMB/HSC/GCE ''A'' Level/NCE in relevant subjects. All candidates must have Geography. UTME: Science Option- five (5) ''O'' level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Geography, and any two (2) of Chemistry, Physics, Biology and Agricultural Science. Social Science Option- English Language, Mathematics, Geography, and any two (2) of Government, Economics, Commerce and Accounting. UTME SUBJECTS: Geography and any other two (2) Science subjects; for Social Science, Geography and any other two (2) Social Science subjects.'),
  ('1b58cc8d-5271-577a-ae0e-2ad8deb1463a', '9ef6e1a9-1447-55f8-9de9-14a6844e1cff', 'a692ff81-1f9e-526d-a07b-f3dad21b728e', 'Accepts: a) Bachelor''s Degree in one (1) of Engineering, Mathematics, Statistics, Physics and Chemistry. b) NCE/ND/HND Lower credit in one (1) of Mathematics, Statistics, Physics and Chemistry. c) GCE ''A'' Level/IJMB/JUPEB Passes in Mathematics and one (1) of Physics, Statistics, Chemistry and Economics. UTME: requires Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Mathematics and any three (3) of Further Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Economics and Geography. UTME SUBJECTS: requires Mathematics, Physics and one of Chemistry, Economics.'),
  ('18175738-0897-5482-a67e-4ac84c2bd1aa', '862dfbdf-bc8b-58e0-9031-c4c30cb2b315', 'a692ff81-1f9e-526d-a07b-f3dad21b728e', 'Accepts NCE, ND or HND in Statistics or related programme.'),
  ('ad54cea4-03f7-51e1-b1b7-756258931c0d', 'fe45832b-9a35-5f0b-bde4-8b7379a5c683', 'a692ff81-1f9e-526d-a07b-f3dad21b728e', NULL),
