  ('28862288-39a3-5847-93b0-1bc05edfa5f3', '43eded73-d8ee-57da-ba48-e8ea86c8fc90', '8a8d5472-6d30-55e3-93c5-c2e576dc754a', 'accepts IJMB/Two (2) A level passes in Mathematics and any one (1) of Physics, Chemistry, Statistics, Economics or Geography. ND/HND/NCE at credit level in Computer Science, Mathematics, Mathematics Education or Statistics. Requires Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Mathematics and any three of Physics, Chemistry, Biology/Agric. Science, Geography, Economics/Commerce, Computer Studies/IT/Data processing. UTME SUBJECTS: requires Mathematics and any two of Chemistry, Biology/Agric Science, Physics, Geography and Economics.'),
